# --- Repo-specific -----------------------------------------------------------
# Everything in data/, checkpoints/ and artifacts/ is small (a few MB in total)
# and IS committed, so the pre-baked presenter path works straight after clone.
# Regenerate any of it with:
#     python scripts/prepare_data.py
#     python scripts/pretrain_all.py
#
# The one exception is the optional ~1 MB tiny-shakespeare download.
data/tinyshakespeare.txt

